  dialogueColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
  startingNode:
    dialogueText: 'Humph... I assume Natalia gave you the key, huh?

      Well,
      I''m sorry to tell you that if you''re hungry, you''ll have to wait for dinner
      just like every other guest.

      So please, let me do my work.'
