    guid:
      Part1: 3590403978
      Part2: 1186015036
      Part3: 4019111299
      Part4: 3889511675
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'There''s two men I haven''t seen since right after they checked
      in... who know what they might be doing upstairs.

      At the same time,
      there''s one who hasn''t left the dining hall since then, as if he was avoiding
      going up where the other two are.

      What''s curious is, I''ve seen the
      man downstairs talk to both of the men upstairs... something might be up between
      those three, and I don''t like it one bit.'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
