    - rid: 767062219271962631
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: "Yes, I know, she sent you in to lie about how \"good\" my
          cooking was so that I would \"feel better\", smile a bit more and not scare
          the guests away when they see me.\nEvery time, she sends some poor guest
          to do that, and every time, they go back sadder than they were when they
          arrived... and yet she never gets the message. \nA word of advice, son:
          it's best if you don't even waste your time trying."
        characterEmotion: 0
        characterReaction: 0
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
