    - rid: 767062219271962642
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: "In that case, you couldn't have found a better man for that.
          \nIf there's something I'm good at, is telling who's about to betray you.
          My betrayal radar never fails.\nOtherwise, you would be speaking to a <b>corpse</b>
          right now. Hah!"
